---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageShell from '../components/PageShell.astro';
import WaterButton from '../components/WaterButton.astro';
import BubbleDivider from '../components/BubbleDivider.astro';
import Sticker from '../components/Sticker.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Me ☆ Gemmie's corner" description="Get to know Gemmie — art equipment, programming, music and games I enjoy.">
  <PageShell showMisc={false}>
    <!-- ================= about me window ================= -->
    <section class="window main-doc">
      <div class="title-bar">
        <span class="title-bar-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Sticker name="orange_goldfish.gif" /></span>
        <span class="title-bar-text">about-me.exe</span>
        <div class="title-bar-controls" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="tb-btn">_</span>
          <span class="tb-btn">□</span>
          <span class="tb-btn close">×</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="window-body">
        <div class="doc-section" id="about-me">

          <div class="article-grid">

            <div class="article-portrait">
              <img src="/images/other_components/GemmieSway.gif" alt="Gemmie holding a pencil" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h1>Gemmie (again.)<span class="sparkle">☆</span></h1>
              <div class="bio-icons">
                <Sticker name="pink_girl.gif" /> 
                <img src="/images/blinkies_stamps_tags/tags/tag_greek.png" alt="Greek" />
                <img src="/images/blinkies_stamps_tags/tags/tag_intp.png" alt="INTP" />
                <img src="/images/blinkies_stamps_tags/tags/tag_sanrio.png" alt="Sanrio" />
                <img src="/images/blinkies_stamps_tags/tags/tag_darkestdungeon.png" alt="Darkness Dungeon" />
              </div>
              <p class="blurb">
                <Sticker name="white_kitty.gif" /> 
                Okay, I KNOW I already made the first blog post a small "trivia" about me,
                but I thought I'd make it a proper page.
              </br>
                <Sticker name="yellow_supermario.gif" /> 
                Below, I'm just gonna be an absolute nerd and yap/ meme about the stuff I love, besides art;
                cause you already know about that <span class="sparkle">☆</span>
              </p>

              <WaterButton
              href="https://code.gemmiewow.com/"
              label="🌍 Visit my Programming Portfolio"
              waterColor="#3fbfc7"
              external
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <BubbleDivider class="bubble-divider-dashed" />

          <h2 class="links-section-heading"><Sticker name="white_nintendo.png" /> Games & more GAMES!</h2>
          <p class="hand-note">Steam - Nintendo - PlayStation</p>
          <p class="blurb">BEHOLD! The games I play:</p>
          <ul class="update-list">
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Favorite game:</strong> Darkest Dungeon.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Rhythm:</strong> Crypt of the Necrodancer, A Dance of Fire and Ice, Just Shapes and Beats, Friday Night Funkin.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Bullet Hell:</strong> Enter the Gungeon, Hades, Metal Slug, Vampire Survivors, Cuphead, Hotline Miami.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Metroidvania:</strong> Blasphemous, Hollow Knight.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>RPG Maker:</strong> Ib, Mad Father, The Witch's House.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Among Us, PEAK, R.E.P.O.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Nintendo:</strong> Dungeon Maker, Crash of the Titans, Lego Star Wars, Lego Harry Potter, Rhythm Heaven.</li>
          </ul>

          </br>
          <h2 class="links-section-heading"><Sticker name="white_nintendo.png" /> A moment to address my favorite game: Darkest Dungeon.</h2>
          <p class="hand-note">
            Waiter waiter! Please, give me more mercenaries spending my MONEY UNREASONABLY! 
          </p>
          
          <div class="article-grid">
            <div class="article-portrait">
              <img src="/images/other_components/MY_MONEY.webp" alt="BROO MY MONEY!" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="blurb">
                <Sticker name="TheFlame.png" /> 
                <i>"Ruin, has come to our family."</i>
                </br>
                </br>
                <Sticker name="dismas_heart.png" /> 
                What an absolute game. Unfair, cruel, unforgiving... <i>and yet so rewarding.</i>
                I love everything, from enviroments and art style, to music, to the story and especially the characters.
                It's a hard game and you get to learn quickly that as safe as you might feel,
                you are actually not. Hire up mercenaries, send them to missions and PROFIT!
                This game introduces a very intersting mechanic, the "stress bar" --
                too much stress, and your heroes go to breakdown until you de-stress them.
                Every win feels like an absolute victory and everytime you don't lose your 
                favorite heroes to missions, it's relief.
                
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="article-grid-3">
            <div class="article-portrait">
              <img class="article-portrait-img" src="https://external-content.duckduckgo.com/iu/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fdarkestdungeon.wiki.gg%2Fimages%2FHwm_wiki.png%3F8ceeb3&f=1&nofb=1&ipt=844d7750edc2329769f9565e5245ff3db0750bd69683e058f4643166eca05074&ipo=images" alt="DISMAS I LOVE YOU" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <center>
              <p class="blurb">
                <Sticker name="ripostecard.png" />
                Dismas I love you so much, you are my best frontline and backline warrior,
                nobody shoots and ripostes like you do.
  
                </br>
                </br>
                <Sticker name="floocube.gif" />
                <i>
                I also got him as a plushie, he's legit my fav character.
                </i>
                <Sticker name="floocube.gif" />
              </p>
              </center>
            </div>
            <div class="article-portrait">
              <img class="article-portrait-img" src="/images/other_components/dismas_plushie.webp" alt="Gemmie's Dismas plushie" />
            </div>
          </div>
          



          <BubbleDivider class="bubble-divider-dashed" />

          <h2 class="links-section-heading"><Sticker name="purple_mp3.gif" />  Music</h2>
          <p class="blurb">I listen to almost anything, but here are some of my favorites:</p>
          <ul class="update-list">
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Heavy Metal:</strong> Avenged Sevenfold, Iron Maiden, Helloween, Katatonia etc.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Rock:</strong> Queen, Muse, Beatles etc.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>EDM:</strong> Monstercat, Nitro Fun, Pegboard Nerds.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Game music:</strong> Darkest Dungeon, Blasphemous, Crypt of the Necrodancer, Minecraft.</li>
            </br
          </ul>
          


           <div class="article-grid">
            
            <div class="article-portrait">
              <img src="/images/other_components/minecraft_cassettes.webp" alt="My minecraft music cassettes" />
              <img src="/images/other_components/cassette_player.webp" alt="My Akai cassette player" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="blurb">
                <Sticker name="blue_musicnotes.png" /> 
                I fully support the idea of having physical copies of your media,
                especially in the current age where you don't really own your online music/ games/ movies.
                If it's physical, it's yours forever!
                Personally, I collect CDs and cassettes or straight up download or buy
                my music from bandcamp creators instead of streaming it on Spotify.
                Used to have a small SanDisk mp3 player too, but I lost it. <Sticker name="frown.png" /> 
                </br>
                </br>
                <p class="blurb">
                <strong>Music equipment I got:</strong>
                <ul class="update-list">
                  <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>CD Player + Radio:</strong> Lamtech Boombox -- RATING: ★★★⯪☆ </li>
                  <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Cassette Player:</strong> Akai Portable Cassette Player -- RATING: ★★★★⯪ </li>
                  <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Mp3 Player:</strong> SanDisk Clip Jam Blue -- RATING: ★★★★★ </li>
                </ul>
                </p>
                <WaterButton
                href="https://bandcamp.com/gemmiewow"
                label="🎧 My bandcamp library"
                waterColor="#a876d9"
                external
                />
                
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>



          <BubbleDivider class="bubble-divider-dashed" />

          <h2 class="links-section-heading"><Sticker name="blue_tv.gif" /> Shows & Movies</h2>
          <p class="hand-note">This is just a glimpse of what I've watched</p>
          <ul class="update-list">
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Cartoon Shows:</strong> Randy Cunningham: 9th Grade Ninja, Pink Panther, Tom & Jerry, Scooby Doo: Mystery Inc, Avatar, Star Wars Rebels, Kim Possible -- my list goes forever, <a href="/images/other_components/gemmies_cartoon_list.txt" class="guestbook-link" target="_blank">click here to view them all.</a> </li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Cartoon Movies:</strong> Treasure Planet, Atlantis, Beauty and the Beast, Megamind, Tangled (GOD I LOVE TANGLED), Monsters Inc, Cars, How to Train your Dragon, Kpop Demon Hunters, Spiderverse 1 +2.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Normal Movies:</strong> Pirates of the Caribbean Movies (I LOVE), Harry Potter Movies, Truman Show, The Mask, The Count of Monte Cristo, Gladiator, Phantom of the Opera.</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Series:</strong> House, Chicago Med, Criminal Minds -- Yall sorry I don't watch series lol</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="article-grid">
            
            <div class="article-portrait">
              <img src="https://external-content.duckduckgo.com/iu/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwallpapers.com%2Fimages%2Fhd%2Ftangled-rapunzel-with-flynn-3g96ejp0dz8kjysb.jpg&f=1&nofb=1&ipt=c27a27aefcc80fa21e0955de1283701a1c16df107dc58e92b6876dc82a6b3a04&ipo=images" alt="Tangled Disnay Movie" />
              <img src="https://external-content.duckduckgo.com/iu/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic0.gamerantimages.com%2Fwordpress%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2Ftangled-image-cropped.jpg&f=1&nofb=1&ipt=8e1d8f1b380264d22b6dd6a4e2ab9f672a8c5078501bb8a6b1330b3b566741a6&ipo=images" alt="Tangled Disnay Movie" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="blurb">
                <Sticker name="floocube.gif" /> 
                WAAA WHAT AN ICONIC MOVIE! I first watched Tangled on my sister's old
                windows XP laptop and, even if I did not understand english cause I was 6 year old,
                I was so mesmerised by the story! Needless to say that Flyn Rider was my first crush,
                if you are a girl you might understand me here. This movie is connected
                to my childhood and specifically to my sister; everytime I rewatch it
                I keep remembering her and her old HP mini laptop with windows XP x)
                </br>
                </br>
                <Sticker name="blue_castle.gif" />
                Not even mentioning how amazing all the songs are, I think all of you know. Diisneeyy
                please make movies like these agaaiin!
                
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>


          <BubbleDivider class="bubble-divider-dashed" />

          <h2 class="links-section-heading"><Sticker name="purple_periwinkle.gif" /> My setup + apps I recommend</h2>
          <ul class="update-list">
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Laptop:</strong> Asus Vivobook -- pretty decent laptop, has carried very well so far. </li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Operating System:</strong> Dual boot Linux Mint & Windows 10</li>
            <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Coding IDE:</strong> Visual Studio Code</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="article-grid">
            
            <div class="article-portrait">
              <center>
              <img src="https://media.tenor.com/DXVOKl5BW-oAAAAj/emoji-looking-surprised-at-computer.gif" alt="Hehe hackerman gif" />
              </center>
              <img src="https://external-content.duckduckgo.com/iu/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.debugpoint.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2FLinux-Mint-21.2-Desktop.jpg&f=1&nofb=1&ipt=ec8494120e6cbc2bf0afecc663c168f9eedcf6f150c48bd8540d7ca9207f8557&ipo=images" alt="Mint" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="blurb">
                <Sticker name="white_penguin.gif" /> 
                I use Linux Mint mostly for all stuff, from work to gaming to just spending my time.
                The only reason why I have dual boot is in case Linux can't run a game I have --
                which as of now, hasn't happened yet hahah.
                Switching over to Mint was a great decision and literally a breath of fresh air
                from Windows 11 and the constant update interuptions. Using the terminal
                ain't so bad after all, even though Mint has a GUI for everything now :p
              </br>
              </br>
                <p class="blurb">
                <strong>Apps I recommend:</strong>
                <ul class="update-list">
                  <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Browser:</strong> Firefox or Brave. Even better, Librewolf </li>
                  <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Search engine:</strong> Startpage or DuckDuckGo </li>
                  <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>VPN:</strong> Mullvad or Proton </li>
                  <li><span class="update-bullet" aria-hidden="true">☆</span> <strong>Mail:</strong> Proton or Tuta </li>
                </ul>
                </p>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>



          <BubbleDivider class="bubble-divider-dashed" />

          <p class="blurb">
            <Sticker name="blue_teddybear.gif" /> That's me in a nutshell! Might add more stuff in time.
            If you wanna, leave me a note in my <a href="/guestbook" class="guestbook-link">guestbook</a> and tell me about your own interests! <span class="sparkle">☆</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </PageShell>
</Layout>
